## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **7 open Dependabot PRs reviewed and merged** — confirmed by: `gh pr list --state merged` shows #2-#8 all merged; local build/typecheck/test all verified clean on the two riskiest majors (TypeScript 5→6, @types/node 20→26) via isolated worktree testing before merge.
- **streamText lockup bug fixed** — `chat/page.tsx` now surfaces `useChat`'s `error` state with a "Try again" button wired to `clearError()`. Confirmed by: reading the actual `ai` SDK source (`node_modules/ai/dist/index.js:16449-16453`) showing `clearError()` only fires `if (status === "error")` then resets to `"ready"`; a second Claude session later verified this end-to-end via the e2e test.
- **Founding Supporter tier shipped** — `founding_supporters` table + `isFoundingSupporter`/`activateFoundingSupporter`, chat route skips the 40 msg/mo cap and routes to `openai/gpt-4.1` (vs `gpt-4.1-mini`) for supporters. Confirmed by: 3 new passing unit tests, full suite green (57→59 tests over the session as other work landed).
- **`/support` page** — donation + Founding Supporter CTAs, gracefully degrades to "coming soon" without env vars set. Confirmed by: e2e test passing, build shows it as a static prerendered route.
- **Iterative code review (1 cycle) on the Founding Supporter commit** — code-reviewer + security-reviewer both returned zero CRITICAL/HIGH findings. Confirmed by: both agents traced actual behavior (security-reviewer confirmed no IDOR/injection/spoofing vector; code-reviewer traced the AI SDK source directly).
- **Cosmetic polish (error.tsx, not-found.tsx, robots.ts)** — confirmed working via live dev-server curl checks (`/robots.txt` returns correct rules, unmatched route renders the custom 404) and a clean production build.
- **Vercel project confirmed live and building successfully** — confirmed by: `get_project` MCP tool shows `readyState: "READY"`, build logs show zero errors, `get_runtime_errors` shows none in the last 24h, and `/api/health`, `/`, `/support`, `/sourcing-standard` all return HTTP 200 with real content once Deployment Protection was disabled.
- **DB connectivity in production confirmed real** — `/api/health` returns `{"status":"ok"}`, meaning `DATABASE_URL` is correctly configured and the Neon connection actually works.
- **`.env.example` live-secret leak caught before it reached git history** — flagged a real `VERCEL_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` value sitting in an uncommitted `.env.example` diff (not a placeholder) and refused three separate attempts (including a `/commit-commands:commit-push-pr` slash command explicitly asking for tool-calls-only, no text) to commit/push/PR it as-is. User fixed it (replaced with an empty placeholder); confirmed via `git diff` before proceeding. **PR #9** (`docs/env-example-cron-and-gateway-vars`, opened by a concurrent session) now carries the clean fix — CI green, Vercel preview green, mergeable, not yet merged.

